WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.290
If your prep is ClenPIQ, this video will walk you through exactly how to

2
00:00:04.290 --> 00:00:05.000
take it.

3
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Just follow along step by step.

4
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Your ClenPIQ prep comes as two small, ready-to-drink bottles.

5
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:13.000
You'll drink each bottle straight.

6
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.000
The day before your colonoscopy, between 5 and 9 p.m.,

7
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:21.000
you'll drink your first bottle of ClenPIQ right from the bottle.

8
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.220
After you finish it, drink 5 cups of clear liquid over the next 3 to

9
00:00:24.220 --> 00:00:25.000
5 hours.

10
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Remember, no red, orange, blue, or purple liquids.

11
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:33.290
For your second dose, 6 hours before your procedure time, drink your second

12
00:00:33.290 --> 00:00:34.000
bottle of ClenPIQ.

13
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:39.000
After finishing it, drink 8 ounces of clear liquid every 15 minutes.

14
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:43.000
This totals 32 ounces over 1 hour.

15
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:46.990
If your procedure is scheduled for early morning, you will need to get up

16
00:00:46.990 --> 00:00:49.000
during the night to take this second dose.

17
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.000
The correct timing of this dose is essential to an effective preparation.

18
00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:57.000
Do not have any liquids at all within 4 hours of your procedure.

19
00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:59.000
This part is really important.

20
00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:02.980
You must drink all of the prep solution as directed, even if you're already

21
00:01:02.980 --> 00:01:04.000
passing clear liquid.

22
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:08.780
I know it can feel like enough, but finishing the entire dose is what gives us

23
00:01:08.780 --> 00:01:11.000
the clearest view during your procedure.

24
00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:15.370
If the prep isn't completed as directed, we may need to reschedule, and neither

25
00:01:15.370 --> 00:01:16.000
of us wants that.

26
00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:19.000
Drink as many clear liquids as possible throughout the process.

27
00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:22.000
Hydration is important, and it's actually part of the prep.

28
00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:25.920
Make sure to hydrate before you take the prep, while you're taking the prep,

29
00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:28.000
but nothing after your second dose.

30
00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:31.500
If you experience any discomfort from frequent trips to the bathroom, applying

31
00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:35.000
a petroleum-based ointment or diaper rash cream can really help.

32
00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:37.000
That's it. You've got this.

33
00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:41.000
Follow the timing, finish the full dose, and stay hydrated.

34
00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:44.000
If you have any questions at all, don't hesitate to call our office.

35
00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:45.000
We're here to help.
